<title>UK: UK's OFT invites comment on Williams -Chubb.</title>
<headline>UK's OFT invites comment on Williams -Chubb.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Office of Fair Trading said on Wednesday it was inviting comment on Williams Holdings Plc's planned 1.3 billion stg purchase of Chubb Security Plc.</p>
<p>The OFT's statement came as part of its routine evaluation of whether acquisitions should be referred to the Monopolies and Mergers Commission for investigation.</p>
<p>The OFT said comments should be received by March 12.</p>
<p>When it launched its agreed bid, Williams said it expected to receive regulatory clearance for the deal, which would unite major brand names in the world security industry.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
